     ],
     "excerpt": "Manufacturers must report any confirmed battery-related thermal runaway, fire, or overheating event requiring emergency response, medical treatment, evacuation, or property damage to the relevant regulator within 72 hours of learning of it.",
     "comparison": "Weaker than the acceptable range: the scope is restricted to serious events, so minor overheating/smoke events are excluded (a weakened S1 parameter). S1's benefit map is 'both', so this weakening of a shared section counts as teaming up."
    }
